%% V0.2 Web 运行后端 —— 启动与终止时序（与 docs/archive/v0.2/architecture-v0.2-web-runner.md §1.2 / §6.4 同源）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as AttachCLI.runPlay
    participant SC as SessionController
    participant GL as GameLauncher
    participant PA as WebPortAssignments
    participant WR as WebGameRunner
    participant SRV as StaticWebServer
    participant BR as BrowserResolver
    participant OS as Chromium Process
    participant AD as MVAdapter
    participant CDP as CDPClient

    Note over CLI,SC: 产品路径（点"启动"）与 --play 走同一段代码，仅入口不同

    SC->>GL: launch(entry, gameRoot, options, log)
    GL->>GL: resolveStrategy(gameRoot, engine)
    alt 命中 nwjs.app 布局
        GL->>OS: run(nwjs, --remote-debugging-port=P)
        GL-->>SC: LaunchHandle(transport=.nwjs, web=nil)
    else Web 运行后端
        GL->>GL: detectWebRoot -> webRoot
        GL->>GL: allocatePort() -> debugPort
        GL->>PA: assign(webRoot, 39310, 39409, isFree)
        PA-->>GL: httpPort（确定性派生 + 持久表）
        GL->>WR: WebGameRunner(config).start()
        WR->>SRV: start() 绑定 127.0.0.1:httpPort
        SRV-->>WR: boundPort
        WR->>BR: resolve(override, log)
        alt 找不到浏览器
            BR-->>WR: throw browser_not_found
            WR->>SRV: stop()
            WR-->>GL: throw
            GL->>PA: release(webRoot)
            GL->>GL: 释放 debugPort / httpPort
            GL-->>SC: throw browser_not_found
        else 找到
            BR-->>WR: BrowserCandidate + launchArguments
            WR->>OS: run(chrome, --app=pageURL, --autoplay-policy=..., --user-data-dir=profile, ...)
            WR->>CDP: waitForReady(debugPort, 15s)
            CDP-->>WR: ready
            WR-->>GL: WebRunHandle
            GL->>GL: webRuns[sessionKey] = WR
            GL-->>SC: LaunchHandle(transport=.webBrowser, web=descriptor)
        end
    end

    SC->>AD: attach(handle, token, config, ...)
    AD->>CDP: waitForReady / listTargets / attach(page)
    AD->>AD: AgentInjector.injectAndHandshake
    AD-->>SC: AttachInfo(pageURL, hooks)
    SC->>AD: startTextPump()
    loop 每 250ms
        AD->>CDP: Runtime.evaluate(__mochibox.drain())
        CDP-->>AD: envelopes
        AD-->>SC: onAgentMessage(text payload)
        SC->>AD: send(.setTranslation(mapKey, ...))
        AD->>CDP: window.__mochibox.inbox(...)
    end

    Note over SC,SRV: 静态服务在会话期间持续响应 GET/HEAD/Range（keep-alive）

    SC->>AD: stop()
    AD->>CDP: push(config disabled) / uninstall()
    AD->>CDP: close()
    AD->>GL: terminate(handle)

    Note over GL,SRV: 终止顺序固定（§6.4）：先收浏览器，再收监听与连接，最后释端口
    GL->>OS: SIGTERM
    GL->>GL: 等 3s
    alt 仍存活
        GL->>OS: SIGKILL
    end
    GL->>WR: stop()
    WR->>SRV: stop()
    SRV->>SRV: listener.cancel()
    SRV->>SRV: 逐个 connection.cancel()
    SRV->>SRV: 关闭全部在飞 FileHandle
    GL->>GL: webRuns.removeValue(sessionKey)
    GL->>GL: usedPorts / usedWebPorts 释放
    GL->>PA: release(webRoot)（保留持久记录，保存档 origin）
    GL->>GL: ChildProcessRegistry.unregister(pid)

    Note over SRV: 停止后 isPortFree(httpPort) == true 且 activeConnections == 0（AC-7 断言）
